WEBVTT

00:06:58.625 --> 00:07:01.430
that free us from pre-designed constraints

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:04.841
by teaching us about the materials themselves.

00:07:04.841 --> 00:07:07.574
So amongst Hannah's many impressive experiments,

00:07:07.574 --> 00:07:09.544
this is one of my favorites.

00:07:09.544 --> 00:07:12.961
["Paper speakers"]

00:07:12.961 --> 00:07:16.239
What we're seeing here is just a piece of paper

00:07:16.239 --> 00:07:20.681
with some copper tape on it connected to an mp3 player

00:07:20.681 --> 00:07:22.334
and a magnet.

00:07:22.334 --> 00:07:29.983
(Music: "Happy Together")